usage: build_features.py [-h] --model397-output MODEL397_OUTPUT --train TRAIN
                         --palette-config PALETTE_CONFIG --out OUT
                         [--b4-dir B4_DIR]

Build F (residual refiner) training features from train70 E OOF probabilities. Never reads valid/test.

    python build_features.py --model397-output OUT --train DATA/train --palette-config PARENT/Model349_exh14/configs/model349_lite.yaml         --out FEATURES [--b4-dir model329]

OUT is the model397 OOF layout written by model397_reproduction_bundle/scripts/run_model397_oof.sh:
    OUT/<b4-dir>/fold{1..4}_oof/probabilities.npz            (B4, team channel order, one key per image)
    OUT/model392/seed{1,2}/fold{1..4}_oof/valid_probabilities.npz  (HRNet, team channel order)
Each train image appears in exactly one fold's OOF archive. Per image (same arithmetic as the original
accuracy81_oof_refiner_20261009/prepare_oof.py):
    E_team = 0.5*B4 + 0.25*HR_seed1 + 0.25*HR_seed2 ; logits = log(max(E_team[[1,2,0,3]], 1e-7))  (route order)
    gray   = L(image)/255 (the trainer applies the z-score transform) ; target = GT mask decoded with the palette
Writes FEATURES/<name>.npz (logits, gray, target) and FEATURES/manifest.json for train_refiner.py.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --model397-output MODEL397_OUTPUT
  --train TRAIN         folder with images/ and masks/ of the 70 train images
  --palette-config PALETTE_CONFIG
  --out OUT
  --b4-dir B4_DIR       B4 OOF family folder (e.g. model329_ws for the warm-
                        started folds)
